<title>USA: CBOE to list Aviron, Sterling Bancorp options.</title>
<headline>CBOE to list Aviron, Sterling Bancorp options.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Chicago Board Options Exchange (CBOE) said Thursday it will list options on Aviron and Sterling Bancorp on August 14.</p>
<p>Aviron options will have opening strike prices of 25, 30 and 35 and introductory expirations in September, October, November and February. The options will trade in the Storage Technology Inc trading crowd.</p>
<p>Sterling Bancorp will open with strikes of 17-1/2, 20 and 22-1/2 and initial expirations in September, October, December and March. Tower Trading has been named designated primary market maker (DPM).</p>
<p>((--Chicago derivatives desk, 312 408 8750))</p>
<p>E-mail: chicago.derivatives.newsroom@reuters.com</p>
